\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces End-to-end methodological pipeline of the source-stratified evaluation benchmark. Photographic image records are processed by a frozen MobileNetV2 backbone (checkpoint SHA-256: \texttt  {4a12f354...b6b4}) to extract penultimate features $h(x) \in \mathbb  {R}^{1280}$ and logits $z(x) \in \mathbb  {R}^6$. Five post-hoc scoring functions are evaluated for continuous OOD ranking. Operating thresholds locked a priori on validation knowns ($N_{\text  {val}} = 227$) govern discrete acceptance ($\hat  {y} \in \{0, \dots  , 5\}$) or rejection ($\hat  {y} = \text  {\textcircled {r}}$) via the Energy--MSP Dual-Gate cascade.}}{21}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:methodological_pipeline}{{1}{21}{End-to-end methodological pipeline of the source-stratified evaluation benchmark. Photographic image records are processed by a frozen MobileNetV2 backbone (checkpoint SHA-256: \texttt {4a12f354...b6b4}) to extract penultimate features $h(x) \in \mathbb {R}^{1280}$ and logits $z(x) \in \mathbb {R}^6$. Five post-hoc scoring functions are evaluated for continuous OOD ranking. Operating thresholds locked a priori on validation knowns ($N_{\text {val}} = 227$) govern discrete acceptance ($\hat {y} \in \{0, \dots , 5\}$) or rejection ($\hat {y} = \text {\textcircled {r}}$) via the Energy--MSP Dual-Gate cascade}{figure.1}{}}
